  "content": "[Intro (Free)]\n[G]\n[G]  [Ab/G]\n[G]  [Ab/G]\n[G]\n\n[Verse (Free)]\n[Cm]Come into my life\n[Fm]Regress into a dream\n[Eb]We will hide\n[G7b13]And build a new reality\n[Cm]Draw another picture\n[Fm]Of a life you could've had\n[Eb]Follow your instincts\n[G7b13]And choose the other path\n\n[Bridge]\n[Fm]\nYou should\n[Cm/Eb]never be afraid\n[G7/D]You're protected\nFrom\n[Cm/Eb]trouble and pain\nWhy,\n[G]\nwhy?\n[Ab]\nIs this\n[Cm/G]a crisis\nIn\n[G]your eyes,\nagain?\n[Cm]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cm]Come to be\nHow did it\n[Fm/C]come to be?\nTied to a\n[Cm]railroad\nNo love to\n[Fm/C]set us free\nWatch our\n[G/B]souls\n[Bb]fade\n[F/A]away\nAnd our\n[Ab]bodies\n[Eb/G]crum-\n[F#dim]bling\nDon't be a-\n[D]fraid\n[D/C]\n[Gm/Bb]\n[D/A]\n[Gm/Bb]\n[D/A]\n[G/F]I will\n[Cm/Eb]take the\n[G7/D]blow for\n[Cm]you\n\n[Outro (Free)]\n[Cm]And I've had recurring nightmares\n[Fm]That I was loved for who I am\n[Eb]And missed the opportunity\n[G7b13]To be a better man\n[Cm]\n[Cmmaj7]",
